- [Joel] Is she soup yet?

703
00:30:11,188 --> 00:30:12,949
- Listen.
- Mm, mm, dud.

704
00:30:12,983 --> 00:30:14,951
- The wind carries well.
- [Dragon growling]

705
00:30:14,985 --> 00:30:17,022
Don't turn your head away.
You'll miss all the fun.

706
00:30:17,056 --> 00:30:18,920
[Joel sniffs]
Ahh.

707
00:30:18,955 --> 00:30:20,853
- See?
- Ah, he does light cues.

708
00:30:20,888 --> 00:30:23,649
