I was trying to think
of something to say.

857
00:37:13,921 --> 00:37:15,647
We're supposed to be on a quest.

858
00:37:15,681 --> 00:37:18,305
We're supposed to be
best friends, and we
haven't even talked yet.

859
00:37:18,339 --> 00:37:20,307
- [Joel] We've talked.
- No, I mean really talked.

860
00:37:20,341 --> 00:37:21,894
All I know about you
is that you're French.

861
00:37:21,929 --> 00:37:23,620
I mean, France
is a big country and all--

862
00:37:23,655 --> 00:37:25,277
- [Joel] Not really.
